Chapter: BvtBrushPass
  cites Uoaix chapter WalkMap
  cites Uoaix chapter BvtCheck

 Damian, 2026-10-10: "brambles, small rocks, and saplings should not block movement". walk-passable is the rule the
 walk map, the decoration and the flora colliders share (install-map-cache.ps1 Brush mirrors it).
  bvt-brush-pass : Integer -> [Console] Integer
  bvt-brush-pass (unused) = act
    a <- bvt-check "brambles, saplings and the small rocks pass, and a chair still does" (walk-passable #0D3F & walk-passable #0D40 & walk-passable #0CE9 & walk-passable #0CEA & walk-passable #1363 & walk-passable #136D & walk-passable #1771 & walk-passable #177C & walk-passable #0B2C)
    b <- bvt-check "a boulder, water with rock, a stone wall and the art beside the rock ranges still block" (not (walk-passable #1355) & not (walk-passable #34AB) & not (walk-passable #001A) & not (walk-passable #1362) & not (walk-passable #136E) & not (walk-passable #1770) & not (walk-passable #177D))
    a + b
  end
